{"id":15646364136,"name":"Absolvement [ALPHA]","desc":"An end of a lifetime, or the beginning of an era? Nobody knows what lies at the end. In fact, most believe there is no end. You struggle to differentiate between your true memories and false ones planted from your fleeting consciousness as you shatter your body but not your soul.\n\n<> Absolvement is currently in the ALPHA development stage. <>\nFundamentals of the game may change as we release updates!\n\n- Play solo or in parties up to 5 players\n- Branded by sins, affixes, and burdens - freely choose your rate of progression and your own personal difficulty\n- Classless character design and progression\n- Over 130 abilities to use and build synergies with\n- Earn Soul Fragments when your character wipes to unlock 200+ buffs in the Soul Tree for your next character\n\nAbsolvement is a roguelite dungeon crawler developed by Amorian Skies.\nNominated in the 2025 Creator Awards for Best Narrative.\nAll in-game music is our own composed OST! \nPlayable on PC and Console with controller support.","path":"/game/15646364136-absolvement","slug":"15646364136-absolvement","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a7663a233ecafd65239568b592db6fe273f34ecfe7a8ce51fdd3dd0182e390ee.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b3ec632f09330ef2a2decbd947df70b2/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":246,"visitor":28524968,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-09T23:49:23.925Z","creator":{"name":"Amorian Skies","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"69af5c7eec95ce09d16446b9","title":"Qwenzy hub autofarm low unc support KEYLESS","game":{"_id":"6818e852b76a6903e9269643","gameId":15646364136,"name":"Absolvement [ALPHA]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a7663a233ecafd65239568b592db6fe273f34ecfe7a8ce51fdd3dd0182e390ee.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b3ec632f09330ef2a2decbd947df70b2/150/150/Image/Png