fbc8b5f3d5f8fb3588ddfad6b.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67ddcfc34f3217284c7535a0-1762687487915.png"}},"text":"Loving the script and it honestly has alot of potential. you said to text your discord to send in suggestions but i would like to stay anonymous so im going to suggest some stuff here. Once auto parry is set up properly you could possibly add a auto roll dodge too. this is because some skills in this game are not parryable and having a auto roll dodge would just negate the dmg taken. auto fishing would also be a good quality of life feature. and improving the auto farm. the auto farm right now works well its just that auto parry doesnt work on every parryable move yet so you are bound to die if fighting tougher opponents. after fixing this u would just need to make the auto farm automatically continue after a dungeon starts and also have it start the dungeon when you load in. now u would just need to make it automatically pick up potentials that have the highest rarity and boom. after that the auto farm could effectively farm soul fragments.","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-11-09T11:34:13.922Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6911a0be4df7d8d33868cde0","commentBy":{"_id":"6519030ecd68c9f961fe1380","username":"m4ar","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2023-10-01T05:26:38.730Z","lastActive":"2026-09-09T04:05:46.014Z","status":"offline","id":"6519030ecd68c9f961fe1380","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"what ui library did u use","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-11-10T08:22:22.021Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6912362d197ba9030ed0e0af","commentBy":{"_id":"67b31ed99816ebf0d3d75f22","username":"bilobakan","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://med